y as they did then in the train  graveyard the ghoul is an all-new boss a  much like the hell house eligor is  another minor enemy encounter from the  original that's gotten the full boss  fire treatment I know about you bye  though is pretty cool leading up to the  collapse of the sector 7 play 20 phase  flying her way up the tower Reno from  his gunship lines up a shot at T foe  with the minigun at the last minute  route swerves the helicopter off balance  and Reno misses why's that you might ask  because as it's revealed during the GaN  Gaga section in the original rules been  crushing hard on Tifa during the sector  7 play collapse cutscene they briefly  show cats eff up in the Shinra building  looking devastated Reve controlling him  from afar was too late in stopping the  Turks from carrying out their mission  needless to say there is an explanation  for the angry weird blue cat we just  haven't got there yet  in the original depending on how you  treated and responded to certain  characters you would wind up on a date  with either Barret Tifa Aerith or yuffie  at the gold saucer while you don't visit  the gold saucer quite yet in the remake  the spirit of that magical night lives  on as depending on how you treat Aerith  and Tifa you're treated to a midnight  rendezvous with one of them or even  Barret the first time we visited Eris  God and we were pretty upset that they  didn't include the cover material from  the original hiding in the bottom-right  corner of a flower patch however later  on in the game you can find a pink  material orb in the same place it was in  the original pretty rad a brand new  character to the series Leslie initially  warns cloud Aerith and Tifa of the  danger that comes with interacting with  don cornell eventually it's revealed  that he possibly lost his fiancee in the  same way years before that and since  then has dedicated his life to ending  the Dawn's in the original the next time  in the story you see d'Anconia is if you  d